MFGLib

The executable port in LeanMFG/Computational/ and the reference fixture generator
adapt algorithms and environment definitions from
MFGLib (https://github.com/radar-research-lab/MFGLib), version 0.3.0,
commit d4adccf134e88ad47e0a517af5175edaec15a30f.
Changes include the Lean implementation, flat arrays, directional automatic
differentiation, a native occupation-measure projection, and native JSON/tuning.

